{
  "name": "OSC Driven",
  "description": "An OSC-driven visual: four OSC In nodes (port 9000, through the I/O bridge) drive a kaleidoscopic glowing ring - /patchtoy/lfo its size and spin, /patchtoy/xy its center, /patchtoy/color its tint, /patchtoy/beat a flash that an OSC Out echoes back to 127.0.0.1:9001. Runs on a built-in LFO until messages arrive. Start npm run io-bridge, pair and enable I/O in Output > I/O, then npm run osc-demo or send from TouchDesigner / Max / Ableton.",
  "version": "1.0",
